{\b ArrowKeys}
\par Install the standalone ArrowKeys menu bar app. While ArrowKeys is active, hold Caps Lock or Option and use J, K, L and I to move the cursor.
\par After installation, ArrowKeys shows how to allow cursor movement in other apps. Choose {\b Open Accessibility Settings} and turn on {\b ArrowKeys}.
\par You can review the source code on GitHub: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/nauroman/arrowkeys"}{\fldrslt\ul github.com/nauroman/arrowkeys}}.
\par Download the installers and SHA-256 checksums to verify your copy: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/nauroman/arrowkeys/releases/latest"}{\fldrslt\ul github.com/nauroman/arrowkeys/releases/latest}}.
}
